<title>JAPAN: Osaka Stadium sets terms on SFR warrant.</title>
<headline>Osaka Stadium sets terms on SFR warrant.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Osaka Stadium Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MANAGER - Nomura Bank (Schweiz)</p>
<p>GUARANTOR - Sanwa Bank, Sumitomo Bank, Sumitomo Trust &amp; Banking</p>
<p> TYPE warrant	     ISSUE NO	 AMT 50 million Swiss francs</p>
<p> COUPON 0.875%	    ISSUE PRICE    MATURITY 26 Sep 2000</p>
<p> EXER PRICE 949 yen     CURR RATE 89.87 yen/SFR</p>
<p> EXER FROM 11 Oct 1996  EXER TO 12 Sep 2000</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	     PAY DATE 26 Sep 1996   INT PAY 26 Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		   SIGN DATE 18 Sep 1996  SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		   LAST JBRI		  LAST NIS</p>
